# The website the app signs in at (the issuer), calls (`/api/...`) and opens pages on. Baked into the build.
# Development: the website's dev server (`pnpm dev`, http://localhost:3000; a device build rewrites localhost with
# MOBILE_LAN=1). Release builds: https://frigear-nu.frigear.workers.dev, where the website from main runs.
NUXT_PUBLIC_AUTHENTICATION_CLIENT_ISSUER=http://localhost:3000
NUXT_PUBLIC_AUTHENTICATION_CLIENT_API_BASE=http://localhost:3000

# Overrides of identity.ts, for example per environment. Leave them commented out to use identity.ts.
# NUXT_PUBLIC_AUTHENTICATION_CLIENT_CLIENT_ID=mobile
# NUXT_PUBLIC_AUTHENTICATION_CLIENT_SCOPE=openid profile email
